<tr><td>Vehicle</td><td>Exact chassis, production context, engine and equipment</td><td>Any BMW uses the same ECU</td></tr>
<tr><td>Symptom</td><td>When, what changed, what still functions</td><td>Dashboard text identifies the part</td></tr>
